{"id":95916278095144,"type":"artist","name":"Anthony Braxton","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":45,"info":{"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Braxton_anthony_moers_260507.jpg?width=500","bio":"Anthony Braxton es una figura imprescindible dentro de la vanguardia de la improvisación. Desconocido para una amplia mayoría pero imprescindible para sus incondicionales. Composiciones numeradas, la obsesiva \"ghost trance music\", aventuras sinfónicas y operísticas... son sólo algunos de los hitos de una larga carrera que continúa. \n\t  \t\nNo hay ninguna duda de que con Anthony Braxton (Chicago, Illinois 1945) nos encontramos ante una de las grandes y fundamentales figuras del jazz contemporáneo.","tags":["free jazz","jazz","Avant-Garde","Avant-Garde Jazz","experimental"]},"works":[{"id":149258752688039,"type":"album","name":"3 Compositions of New Jazz","artist":"Anthony Braxton","year":1968,"weight":9,"yt":"fLC0YaI-LF4","src":"books,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Historia del jazz","title":"Historia del jazz (Ted Gioia)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":60045461525049,"name":"RYM Top — Experimental — Modern Creative","rank":24,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":238450968402478,"type":"work","name":"For John Cage","artist":"Anthony Braxton","year":1968,"weight":6,"yt":"ceeUhorJ39I","src":"books","from":{"books":[{"name":"Historia del jazz","title":"Historia del jazz (Ted Gioia)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[],"n_lists":0}},{"id":34436104521134,"type":"album","name":"Anthony Braxton [B-X° / N O I 47ᴬ]","artist":"Anthony Braxton","year":1969,"weight":3,"yt":"XWyAYDuwYG4","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":60045461525049,"name":"RYM Top — Experimental — Modern Creative","rank":45,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":62718451940244,"type":"album","name":"This Time...","artist":"Anthony Braxton","year":1970,"weight":3,"yt":"cQBwORcXv6Q","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":60045461525049,"name